  "body_html": "<h1>IsWeaklyDominant.isBestResponse</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem IsWeaklyDominant.isBestResponse {G : StrategicGame N U} {i : N} {s : G.strategy i} (hdom : IsWeaklyDominant G i s) (σ : G.Profile) (hσ : σ i = s) : IsBestResponse G σ i</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategy</li>\n<li>IsStrictlyDominant.isWeaklyDominant</li>\n<li>IsWeaklyDominant</li>\n<li>Profile</li>\n<li>IsBestResponse</li>\n<li>deviate_self</li>\n</ul>",
